685
00:43:15.033 --> 00:43:18.067
- Oh, ako din?
- Oo.

686
00:43:18.067 --> 00:43:21.033
Teka, check mo lang yung akin. Bakit tingnan din ang kanyang ID?

687
00:43:21.033 --> 00:43:22.600
Ito ay pamamaraan. Hindi matutulungan.

688
00:43:22.600 --> 00:43:24.400
Dapat tayo.

689
00:43:24.400 --> 00:43:26.067
Ibigay mo, Miss.

690
00:43:28.733 --> 00:43:30.967
