756
00:46:51.133 --> 00:46:54.000
Sige, umalis na kayong dalawa.

757
00:46:59.767 --> 00:47:01.100
- Paalam, Dong Min.
- Oo.

758
00:47:01.100 --> 00:47:02.833
- Magandang trabaho.
- Oo.

759
00:47:02.833 --> 00:47:05.300
